# Gamblock AI Browser Extension

Read and follow @AGENTS.md, @docs/ai/README.md, and `README.md` in this
repository. Context version: `2026-07-15.2`.

The extension is a passive sensor only. It must not classify, block, redirect,
close tabs, render Pattern Interrupt UI, send browsing data to a backend, or
change the documented WebSocket shapes independently. Relay is permitted only
to the authenticated loopback Windows Service.

`content_script.js` is a classic MV3 content script; do not introduce top-level
ESM syntax. Ensure manifest-referenced locales, scripts, pages, and images are
present in every release ZIP. Run only `npm run lint` plus context validation
by default; tests and package verification require explicit user request.
